cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived outputs, please cite this repository and the associated manuscript."
type: software
title: "N0/R53 zero-input collapse of steel moment frames: analysis code and derived outputs"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, frozen protocol and derived numerical outputs for a study of
  collapse commitment in steel moment-frame archetypes under zero input. The
  campaign halts the ground motion along collapse histories of ten published
  archetypes (2-20 storeys, bare and composite-gravity variants, 100 FEMA P695
  records each) and tests whether commitment to collapse is governed by an
  energy barrier of the damaged configuration. Repository contents support the
  tables and figures of the associated manuscript; the ground-motion records
  and the archetype model sources are not redistributed.
